; cluster for cell biology: cell, mitochondria, ribosome, metabolism, ATP.
; the cell is the fundamental unit of life — eka-kosha (single compartment).
; metabolism is the continuous chain of chemical reactions that sustains life.
; sangati roots

(kosha cell-varga
  (vishesa biology-varga)
  (swarupa subanta spanda)
  (yukta sva-dharana seema avastha kaala))
